摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Web page reader for DeepSeek Harness: clean markdown/text extraction, link inventory, RSS/Atom feeds, HTTP header probes, HTML tables, page metadata (canonical/OG/hreflang/JSON-LD) and site URL inventories from robots.txt + sitemap.xml — zero runtime dependencies","id":"gh:1333559285","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-webfetch","slug":"TYEclipse/dsh-webfetch","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","feed-reader","html-table","http-headers","proxy","redirects","robots-txt","rss","sitemap","sitemap-index","table-extraction","web-scraping"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Web page reader for DeepSeek Harness: clean markdown/text extraction, link inventory, RSS/Atom feeds"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", HTTP header probes, HTML tables, page metadata (canonical/OG/hreflang/JSON-LD) and site URL invent"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ories from robots.txt + sitemap.xml — zero runtime dependencies"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-webfetch"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 为 DeepSeek Harness 智能体装上「阅读器」：给定 URL，抓取网页并提取干净的 Markdown / 纯文本正文，附带链接清单、RSS/Atom 订阅源解析、HTTP 头部探测、网"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"页表格结构化提取与页面元数据（canonical / Open Graph / hreflang / JSON-LD）读取。零运行时依赖，只读，不发送任何凭证。\n> English | 中文简介"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A web page reader plugin for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`).\n`dsh` agents can search, but until now they c"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ould not *read the page behind a URL*.\n`dsh-webfetch` closes that gap with seven read-only tools and"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" **zero runtime dependencies** (Node built-ins + global `fetch` only)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### `web_fetch`"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Fetch a web page and extract its readable content."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Parameter     | Type                 | Default    | Description                                   "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"Type                 | Default    | Description                                                    |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `url`         | string (required)    | —          | Full http/https URL of the page to fetch.     "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"                 |\n| `format`      | `'markdown' \\| 'text'` | `markdown` | Markdown keeps headings, "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"links, lists and code fences; `text` is plain prose. |\n| `extractLinks`| boolean              | `fal"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"se`    | Also return every link found on the page (resolved, absolute). |\n| `maxChars`    | number  "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"             | `50000`    | Cap on extracted content length (1000–200000).                 |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Returns `{ url, finalUrl, status, title, content, length, truncated, links? }`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### `web_links`"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Collect every link on a page with its visible label, resolved to absolute\nURLs, deduplicated, capped"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" at `limit` (1–200, default 50). Useful for mapping\nwhat a page points to or crawling site structure"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"at `limit` (1–200, default 50). Useful for mapping\nwhat a page points to or crawling site structure."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### `web_feed`"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Read an RSS 2.0 or Atom feed and return its entries as a clean,\nLLM-friendly listing. Feed URLs are "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"XML documents that `web_fetch` cannot\nextract from — `web_feed` parses them into structured entries "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ments that `web_fetch` cannot\nextract from — `web_feed` parses them into structured entries instead."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Parameter        | Type              | Default | Description                                      "},{"id":"p16s2","text":" | Type              | Default | Description                                                       |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `url`            | string (required) | —       | Full http/https URL of the RSS or Atom feed.     "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"                 |\n| `maxItems`       | number            | `10`    | Max entries to return (1–50). "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"                                    |\n| `includeContent` | boolean           | `false` | Also return"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" each entry's full content (else summaries only).      |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Returns `{ url, finalUrl, status, feedTitle, entryCount, truncated, entries }`,\nwhere each entry is "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"`{ title, url, published?, author?, summary?, content? }`\nwith CDATA unwrapped, HTML entities decode"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"d, markup stripped and relative\nlinks resolved against the feed URL."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### `web_headers`"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Inspect the HTTP status, response headers and redirect chain of a URL\n**without downloading the page"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" body** — the diagnostic companion to\n`web_fetch`: check status codes, content types, redirects, cac"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"hing or\nsecurity headers before (or instead of) pulling the content. Uses `HEAD`\nby default and fall"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"s back to `GET` automatically when the server answers\n405/501; unlike `web_fetch`, *any* status is r"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"eported (404/500/… included)\nrather than thrown."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Parameter         | Type              | Default | Description                                     "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"                         |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| `url`             | string (required) | —       | Full http/https URL to inspect.                 "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"                         |\n| `method`          | `'HEAD' \\| 'GET'` | `HEAD`  | `HEAD` downloads no b"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ody; `GET` always works but transfers the body.     |\n| `followRedirects` | boolean           | `tru"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"e`  | Follow redirects and report every hop of the chain.                      |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Returns `{ url, finalUrl, status, statusText, method, headers, redirects }`\nwhere `headers` is the f"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ull response-header map (lower-cased keys) and\n`redirects` lists each hop as `{ url, status, locatio"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"esponse-header map (lower-cased keys) and\n`redirects` lists each hop as `{ url, status, location }`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 中文简介"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"dsh-webfetch 是 DeepSeek Harness 的网页阅读插件：智能体拿到 URL 后可以直接抓取页面并提取干净的 Markdown 或纯文本（保留标题、链接、列表与代码块，剥离脚本/"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"样式），`web_links` 可列出页面全部链接（解析为绝对地址、去重、限量），`web_feed` 可解析 RSS 2.0 / Atom 订阅源为条目清单（标题/链接/发布时间/作者/摘要/正文，"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"处理 CDATA、HTML 实体与相对链接），`web_headers` 可用 HEAD 请求探测任意 URL 的 HTTP 状态码、响应头与重定向链而不下载正文（服务器不支持 HEAD 时自动回退 "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"GET，非 2xx 状态照常报告），`web_table` 可把页面上的 HTML 表格提取为结构化行（表头识别、colspan/rowspan 网格展开、行列上限，定价页/参数表/对比表直接可用），"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"`web_meta` 可读取页面自身的元数据（标题、描述、canonical、语言与字符集、robots、作者、Open Graph/article/Twitter 属性、hreflang 多语言版本"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"、订阅源自动发现、图标与 JSON-LD 的 @type 摘要；解析失败的 JSON-LD 如实报错而不丢弃），`web_sitemap` 可从 robots.txt 的 `Sitemap:` 指令枚"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"举整站 URL（跟随 sitemap 索引、带 lastmod/changefreq/priority、相对地址解析为绝对地址、重复折叠；抓取失败或 gzip 压缩的 sitemap 带原因列出而不中"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"断整次查询）。零运行时依赖、只读、不发送凭证；http/https 协议限定、超时/重定向/体积/文本长度全部有上限，字符集自动识别（Content-Type → XML 声明/meta → UTF-"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"8）；内置零依赖 http 代理支持（CONNECT 隧道 + NO_PROXY 白名单，自动读环境变量），在必须走代理的网络也能正常工作。与内置搜索互补：搜索给线索，webfetch 读正文，web"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"_meta 读身份，web_headers 读前诊断，web_table 提数据，web_sitemap 列全站。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
